<title>USA: Mankato, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Mankato, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co. said it won $3.465 million of Mankato, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1996 A,  with a true interest cost of 4.66 percent.</p>
</text>
